Z||000000||88formula||07-06-2001||08:27 PM||||Got the engine mostly put together today. The picture you members provided was a great help. There were a few situations that slowed me down though Like going to Kick Hill to get a few small parts I needed (3-1/2 hours) and taking a part of the exhaust to the welder (1-1-2 hours). I also put just about every part on backwards before I put it on straight like the bottom intake and valve covers<P>Hopefully tomorrow I can get the engine into the car. I plan on putting the wheels on and rolling the whole cradle, engine and all, under the car that I will raise up; it’s in the background. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Img_0518_3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Img_0519.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Img_0516.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
