Z||000011||88formula||07-08-2001||02:12 AM||||The heat shield is stock for an 88 fiero.<P>Earlier that morning I was lying on the ground under my car. All of a sudden I started to get itchy and I felt like something was crawling all over me. There was something crawling on me; it was a whole nest of angry ants and they were all over me biting and crawling on me because I disturbed their nest. I freaked out, pulled my shirt off and did the hula dance until every last ant was removed from my body.  From someone else’s perspective I looked like Tom Hanks in the movie the Money Pit doing the dance with the bugs all over him while his wife was listening to opera. Kind of funny!<P>Here is what it looks like going in.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Img_0521.jpg">   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Img_0522.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 07-08-2001).]||||reg||1
